      "content": "okay, but how do you reconcile that \"absolute\" status with the fact that a lot of satirists use actual hate speech or harmful stereotypes to make their point? if a user posts a meme that uses a slur but claims it's \"satirizing\" a bigot, most moderation teams would flag that immediately for safety reasons. aren't you saying the platforms should just ignore those safety risks to protect the satire?",
